    <<if $CheatsMenu != 1>>
    <span style="color:Azure"><big><strong>--Ryker Simple Quest Guide--</strong></big></span><br>
    <span style="color:Grey">(Detailed Quest guides require Cheats to be enabled.)</span><br>

